o  configure their connections based on the  patterns of their experience in order to  divide complex perception into discrete  categories or concepts but we still have  trouble proving mathematically why they  work so well what is going on inside a  neural network from a math  manacle perspective how do we formally  define what the concept of a dog is from  the perspective of a neural network and  secondly how do we extend this intuitive  style of computing to encompass logic  and handle problems which are sequential  in nature  [Music]

